  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would exceed the recommended width for a dropped kerb, fail to provide appropriate visibility splays of 2.4 metres x 2.4 metres either side of the proposed access, fail to achieve the required 1.2 metres separation from the existing crossover and sufficient access for safe vehicle movements, harmful to the free flow and safety of pedestrians and vehicles on the local highway network, contrary to adopted Local Plan Policy EC2 (Developing a sustainable local transport network) and the Residential Crossovers and Off-Street Parking Policy.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would result in a second crossover at the property with a hardstanding constructed of non-permeable materials and would unnecessarily result in loss of soft landscaping, harmful to the character and appearance of the site and wider area contrary to Local Plan Policies SC7, CC1 and CC2 and the Residential Crossovers and Off-Street Parking Policy."
